        },
        "description": "Kandata is a bandit who kills people without mercy. He is energetic and sadistic. He also sees fun and entertainment when committing crimes.     ~!In the end he is killed by the king and sent to &quot;hell&quot; where he becomes confused, scared, and lost. When the spider sends its thread down from heaven for Kandata, he pushes all of the &quot;others&quot; away so he can be the only one to climb out. However, his greediness pays the price and the thread snaps while the spider turns away. !~    He appears in the story &quot;The Spider&#039;s Thread&quot; otherwise known as episode 11. The Mangaka of Bleach (Tite Kubo) designed him.",
